{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kill or be killed \u2014 there\u2019s no in-between.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>BLACK STIGMA</strong>, ruthless masters from rival syndicates clash in brutal battles for control of the city\u2019s underworld. Whether it\u2019s long-range gunfights, close-quarters brawling, stealthy ambushes, or full-on chaos\u2014every tactic is fair game. Your choices and strategy shape the outcome of every fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tune the perfect weapon to fit your hand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand out on the battlefield with bold, stylish firearms that match your unique combat flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Master. Dominate Your Way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your battlefield role and play to your strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/2b7bf4cf1a28c727f57e8d4c8b8dc23a.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/2b7bf4cf1a28c727f57e8d4c8b8dc23a.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/2b7bf4cf1a28c727f57e8d4c8b8dc23a.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No time to relax \u2014 every mode is a fight to the finish.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into diverse modes and feel the deadly charm of every killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/9e01fc955a7870a2ed5d4cfbf9ed359d.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/9e01fc955a7870a2ed5d4cfbf9ed359d.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/9e01fc955a7870a2ed5d4cfbf9ed359d.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Killer\u2019s World, Straight Out of a Movie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From abandoned subways to secret hideouts and luxury rooftops\u2014every map is crafted like a cinematic setpiece, plunging you deep into the shadows of a city built on blood and betrayal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this world of conspiracies and double-crosses, the only thing more reliable than your instincts... is your trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/685ef3ddac977fce9632c6f0a1fc7e16.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/685ef3ddac977fce9632c6f0a1fc7e16.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/685ef3ddac977fce9632c6f0a1fc7e16.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1277530?t=1752129162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/88aa708d4dd45c223b5068b4ce5a7902e266f91a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752129162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/0807298e182a5d0201872dbf555d7ad7b214c88f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752129162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/0807298e182a5d0201872dbf555d7ad7b214c88f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752129162","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent violence, gore, and general mature content, and is not suitable for all ages."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Kill or be killed \u2014 there\u2019s no in-between.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>BLACK STIGMA</strong>, ruthless masters from rival syndicates clash in brutal battles for control of the city\u2019s underworld. Whether it\u2019s long-range gunfights, close-quarters brawling, stealthy ambushes, or full-on chaos\u2014every tactic is fair game. Your choices and strategy shape the outcome of every fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/c6f448ccda467e48032525956b57e88f.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tune the perfect weapon to fit your hand.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand out on the battlefield with bold, stylish firearms that match your unique combat flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.poster.avif?t=1752129162\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.webm?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/bd57ab9941eab7d3b0d0209059b51180.mp4?t=1752129162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Master. Dominate Your Way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your battlefield role and play to your strengths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/2b7bf4cf1a28c727f57e8d4c8b8dc2